{"seq":3,"slug":"tencent","title":"腾讯","stage":"DONE","category":"corporate-management","chapterCount":7,"docCount":30,"url":"/h/corporate-management/tencent","rating":{"composite":3.93,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.3,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":4}},"introMarkdown":"# 腾讯 简介\n\n腾讯控股有限公司成立于 1998 年，由马化腾、张志东等五位创始人在深圳创办。从最初的即时通讯工具 OICQ（后更名为 QQ）起步，腾讯用二十余年时间成长为全球市值最高的互联网企业之一，业务覆盖社交通讯、游戏娱乐、金融科技、云计算、企业服务等领域。截至 2024 年，腾讯拥有超过十万名员工，微信月活跃用户突破十三亿。\n\n腾讯的管理哲学在中国互联网企业中独树一帜。它既不像华为那样以军事化纪律驱动组织，也不像阿里巴巴那样以强势文化统一意志，而是选择了一条\"温和而坚定\"的路径——强调产品驱动、用户至上、内部竞争与开放生态并存。这种管理风格深受创始人马化腾工程师出身的气质影响：务实、低调、注重细节、信任专业判断。\n\n本系列文档从四个维度深入剖析腾讯的企业管理实践：\n\n**第一章 文化与价值观**梳理腾讯从\"用户为本\"到\"科技向善\"的文化演进脉络，展示一家超大型企业如何在不同发展阶段重新定义自身使命。\n\n**第二章 绩效体系**解构腾讯的星级评定、活水计划与专业职级通道，呈现其人才评价与流动的制度设计逻辑。\n\n**第三章 组织与人才**聚焦赛马机制、事业群制与内部开源文化，探讨腾讯如何在庞大组织中保持创新活力与协同效率。\n\n**第四章 战略与方法论**分析产品经理文化、\"连接一切\"战略与投资生态思维，揭示腾讯从做产品到做平台、从竞争到共生的战略演化逻辑。\n\n腾讯的管理实践对于理解中国互联网行业的组织创新、产品方法论与生态战略具有重要参考价值。无论是创业者、产品经理还是企业管理者，都能从腾讯的经验中获得关于平衡控制与放权、效率与创新、商业与责任之间张力的深刻启示。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"culture-and-values","title":"腾讯的文化与价值观","docCount":6,"url":"/h/corporate-management/tencent/culture-and-values","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"user-oriented-philosophy","title":"用户为本：腾讯的产品哲学基石","url":"/h/corporate-management/tencent/culture-and-values/user-oriented-philosophy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tech-for-good","title":"科技向善：从商业至上到使命升级","url":"/h/corporate-management/tencent/culture-and-values/tech-for-good"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tencent-culture-evolution","title":"腾讯文化三次进化：危机驱动的自我革新","url":"/h/corporate-management/tencent/culture-and-values/tencent-culture-evolution"},{"seq":4,"slug":"mission-and-vision","title":"腾讯的使命与愿景","url":"/h/corporate-management/tencent/culture-and-values/mission-and-vision"},{"seq":5,"slug":"core-values-detail","title":"腾讯核心价值观详解","url":"/h/corporate-management/tencent/culture-and-values/core-values-detail"},{"seq":6,"slug":"culture-practice","title":"腾讯文化的落地机制","url":"/h/corporate-management/tencent/culture-and-values/culture-practice"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"performance-system","title":"腾讯的绩效体系","docCount":3,"url":"/h/corporate-management/tencent/performance-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"star-rating-system","title":"星级评定制度：腾讯的绩效分层哲学","url":"/h/corporate-management/tencent/performance-system/star-rating-system"},{"seq":2,"slug":"talent-flow-program","title":"活水计划：打破组织壁垒的人才流动机制","url":"/h/corporate-management/tencent/performance-system/talent-flow-program"},{"seq":3,"slug":"professional-development-track","title":"专业职级体系：技术人才的双通道设计","url":"/h/corporate-management/tencent/performance-system/professional-development-track"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"org-and-talent","title":"腾讯的组织与人才","docCount":3,"url":"/h/corporate-management/tencent/org-and-talent","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"horse-racing-mechanism","title":"赛马机制：内部竞争催生创新的双刃剑","url":"/h/corporate-management/tencent/org-and-talent/horse-racing-mechanism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"business-group-model","title":"事业群制：从功能型到联邦型的组织演进","url":"/h/corporate-management/tencent/org-and-talent/business-group-model"},{"seq":3,"slug":"internal-open-source","title":"内部开源文化：大公司的协作进化","url":"/h/corporate-management/tencent/org-and-talent/internal-open-source"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"strategy-and-methodology","title":"腾讯的战略与方法论","docCount":3,"url":"/h/corporate-management/tencent/strategy-and-methodology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"product-manager-culture","title":"产品经理文化：腾讯的核心竞争力基因","url":"/h/corporate-management/tencent/strategy-and-methodology/product-manager-culture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"connect-everything","title":"\"连接一切\"战略：从做产品到做平台","url":"/h/corporate-management/tencent/strategy-and-methodology/connect-everything"},{"seq":3,"slug":"investment-ecosystem","title":"投资生态战略：做\"最佳合伙人\"而非征服者","url":"/h/corporate-management/tencent/strategy-and-methodology/investment-ecosystem"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"level-and-compensation","title":"腾讯职级体系与薪酬","docCo